sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Public user
    participant UI as Feedback UI
    participant M as Feedback model
    participant S as Browser storage
    actor A as Authorised staff
    opt staff review occurs through the proposed dashboard
        loop each valid update to an existing report
            A->>UI: Choose status and add a progress note or response
            UI->>M: updateStatus(reference,<br/>status, note)
            M->>S: getItem(key)
            S-->>M: saved reports
            M->>M: Set status#59; add history
            M->>S: setItem(key, reports)
            S-->>M: write completed
            M-->>UI: updated report
            UI-->>A: Display the saved status and history
        end
    end
    U->>UI: Enter reference
    break empty or malformed reference
        UI-->>U: Show reference error
    end
    UI->>M: find(reference)
    M->>S: getItem(key)
    S-->>M: saved reports
    M-->>UI: report or null
    alt matching report found
        UI-->>U: Show report and reply
    else no matching report
        UI-->>U: Show no matching report
    end
